WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.316 --> 00:00:18.290
Once a time, there was a young prince.

2
00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.453
He smiled and laughed all day long.

3
00:00:24.655 --> 00:00:29.840
His parents, the king and queen, always said, "You're the perfect child!"

4
00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:35.608
And they made sure the prince got everything he ever wanted.

5
00:00:37.229 --> 00:00:39.271
And reader, I mean everything!

6
00:00:40.612 --> 00:00:42.554
He said, "I want a pony!"

7
00:00:42.574 --> 00:00:46.798
His parents gave him ten.

8
00:00:49.941 --> 00:00:52.423
He said, "I want a new belt!"

9
00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:57.288
They gave him one with two rubies and a sapphire.

10
00:00:59.328 --> 00:01:01.810
You might think that was why the prince was so happy.

11
00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:04.591
But you'd be wrong.

12
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.255
The prince was happy because he never got into trouble.

13
00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:17.139
Not even when he behaved badly, which was most days!

14
00:01:23.362 --> 00:01:25.984
A nursemaid, Nana, watched over the prince.

15
00:01:27.828 --> 00:01:31.250
Nana was loving and gentle—and very good at her job.

16
00:01:33.672 --> 00:01:38.876
Every day she'd gently remind him, "You are a very smart boy."

17
00:01:42.218 --> 00:01:44.379
Every night she'd tuck him into bed.

18
00:01:44.399 --> 00:01:48.542
"A wonderful future awaits you, my precious prince."

19
00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:54.666
But there was one thing Nana hadn't yet succeeded in doing.

20
00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:57.288
And it bothered her deeply.

21
00:01:59.876 --> 00:02:02.097
"I was sent to this castle for one reason.

22
00:02:03.258 --> 00:02:06.659
I must make sure he becomes a kind king."

23
00:02:09.861 --> 00:02:12.962
So, she kept trying to teach him to be kind.

24
00:02:12.982 --> 00:02:18.865
"Your kingdom has many poor and sad families," she'd say.

25
00:02:20.465 --> 00:02:22.046
The prince would just shrug.

26
00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:23.447
"Oh well!

27
00:02:23.707 --> 00:02:26.168
My family is rich and happy!"

28
00:02:31.796 --> 00:02:34.379
Nana finally went to the king for advice.

29
00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.983
When the king heard how his son was acting, he grinned.

30
00:02:40.224 --> 00:02:41.305
"Wonderful news!

31
00:02:42.246 --> 00:02:44.628
He will make a fine king one day!"

32
00:02:48.451 --> 00:02:50.413
Next, Nana went to the queen.

33
00:02:51.514 --> 00:02:53.396
But the queen covered her ears.

34
00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:57.599
"My son is a perfect angel!"

35
00:03:00.564 --> 00:03:03.347
Nana knew then that she was all on her own.

36
00:03:06.209 --> 00:03:09.792
She was the only one who could teach the prince about kindness.

37
00:03:11.213 --> 00:03:12.454
But time was running out.

38
00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:18.960
prince is growing up," she thought.

39
00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:22.043
"Soon he won't need me anymore.

40
00:03:23.924 --> 00:03:27.768
Yet his heart is growing harder and colder by the day."

41
00:03:29.472 --> 00:03:33.073
It was time to do something—something magical.

42
00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:37.275
You see, reader, Nana wasn't just a nursemaid.

43
00:03:38.215 --> 00:03:39.415
She was a fairy.

44
00:03:43.317 --> 00:03:45.917
And it was the fairy queen who had sent her there.

45
00:03:45.937 --> 00:03:53.200
"The next king must be kind and fair," the fairy queen had said.

46
00:03:56.404 --> 00:03:59.448
Nana had never used magic at the castle before.

47
00:03:59.468 --> 00:04:05.356
"But now," she thought, "I will do what I must do."
